<title>CHINA: China Jan-Feb crude oil, natural gas output up.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Feb crude oil, natural gas output up.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 26.1432 million tonnes of crude oil in the first two months of 1997, up 1.0 percent from the year-ago period, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 12.4148 million tonnes of crude oil in February alone, the bureau said without giving a comparison for 1996.</p>
<p>China's natual gas output reached 3.6 billion cubic metres in January and February, up 10.3 percent from the same two months in 1996, it said.</p>
<p>Natural gas output in February alone was 1.776 billion cubic metres, it said without giving a comparative figure.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
